{'symbol': 'FOX', 'date': '2022-10-14 18:00:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION FORMS SPECIAL COMMITTEE TO BEGIN EXPLORING A POTENTIAL COMBINATION WITH NEWS CORPORATION', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES , OCT. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOX CORPORATION ("FOX" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: FOX, FOXA) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, FOLLOWING THE RECEIPT OF LETTERS FROM K. RUPERT MURDOCH AND THE MURDOCH FAMILY TRUST, HAS FORMED A SPECIAL COMMITTEE COMPOSED OF INDEPENDENT MEMBERS OF THE BOARD (THE "SPECIAL COMMITTEE") TO BEGIN EXPLORING A POTENTIAL COMBINATION WITH NEWS CORPORATION ("NEWS CORP") (NASDAQ: NWS, NWSA; ASX: NWS, NWSLV).'}